WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.546
A white Waymo Jaguar I-PACE with roof-mounted and body-mounted sensors drives past a large white building with a patterned facade. Traffic lights and a marked intersection are visible.

00:04.546 --> 00:13.221
A wider moving view follows the vehicle past a silver curved building and across marked intersections. Other cars travel in neighboring lanes; crosswalks and downtown buildings pass in the background.

00:13.221 --> 00:20.020
The scene changes to dusk. The Waymo vehicle approaches with its headlights on, with other cars behind it. This official Waymo footage provides real-world context, separate from the paper's simulation.
